	(text "POWER-ON RESET SCHMITT: PA = NOT PN, PB = NOT PA; PN is the RC node through 100k with 1 Meg from PB (drawn on the sheet).  While PA is high (the capacitor still low) RD = NOT PB, a 1k pull-up, drives RST through 100 ohm and a diode; the panel's 10k pull-down releases it in tens of microseconds (D053)"
